[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Frametop Gaze Probe (development)
GenericName=Eye tracking development tool
Comment=For developing Frametop's gaze tracking. Day to day, the calibration and checks are on the Gaze page of Frametop Input Settings
Exec=@REPO@/gaze/probe/ft-gazeprobe
Icon=view-visible
Categories=Development;
# Not in SteamVR's Launch a program list (Steam runs in gamescope): it's in the Frametop menu (menu/ft-menu.desktop).
NotShowIn=gamescope;
X-Frametop-Menu=tools
Keywords=eye;gaze;tracking;calibration;pointer;steamvr;frametop;
